------------------------------------------------------------------------
0. Relationship to DRerio LogAI
------------------------------------------------------------------------
PyZebArdYolo is the real-time acquisition unit (webcam + YOLO11 detection +
Arduino-driven position-contingent stimulation) developed by the same
authors. It is NOT the same software as "DRerio LogAI: Software de
Rastreamento Comportamental Automatizado de Peixes-Zebra com Visão
Computacional, Suporte Multi-Aquário e Geração de Relatórios Estatísticos",
a separate, more advanced multi-aquarium tracking/reporting platform whose
titular (per Brazilian copyright registration, Lei 9.609/98) is the
Universidade Estadual Paulista "Júlio de Mesquita Filho" (UNESP), INPI
process BR 51 2026 005215-7, filed 07/07/2026. This repository is
independent of that registration and no PI/AUIN authorization was required
to make it public.

